  "description": "Our company has its roots in building fixies, the purest form of cycling. Building on that foundation, we craft our frames using high quality Reynolds 525 steel, delivering a refined balance of strength, responsiveness, and ride feel.\n\nOur TIG welded construction ensures strong, reliable joints, paired with a geometry optimized for efficient power transfer and confident handling on the road.\n\nThe ZANSKAR ROAD is built with one purpose, speed on tarmac. Designed for fast, uninterrupted riding, it features a Tange lugged bent fork that brings precise handling along with a timeless, classic aesthetic. The frame is engineered for up to 28C tire clearance, with no provision for fenders, keeping the setup clean, tight, and performance focused.\n\nThe result is a bike that feels quick, direct, and responsive under acceleration, made for riders who value speed, simplicity, and the raw experience of steel on open roads.\n\nFixed Gear and Single Speed. The Rear Hub is equipped with a Flip Flop Hub having a Fixed Gear Cog and a Freewheel. Click here to know about Fixed Gear Technology.",
